@startuml
title UML State Transition Diagram - Weather Station System

state "Running" as Running
Running : entry/start running
Running : exit/shutdown command
Running : do/data collection on clock trigger
Running : do/send weather summary upon request
Running : do/check status upon request

state "Configuration Mode" as ConfigurationMode
ConfigurationMode : entry/configure settings
ConfigurationMode : exit/configuration completed

state "Controlled Mode" as ControlledMode
ControlledMode : entry/remote control command
ControlledMode : exit/some condition (assumed)

state "Shutdown" as Shutdown
Shutdown : entry/shutdown command
Shutdown : exit/power off

[*] --> Running

Running --> ConfigurationMode : change request/power-saving settings
Running --> ControlledMode : remote control command
Running --> Shutdown : shutdown command

ConfigurationMode --> Running : configuration completed

ControlledMode --> Running : (ass
@enduml
